---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const pageTitle = "我的项目";
---
<Layout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <div class="gif">
    <img src="/images/laptop.webp" alt="JIA 的数码与开发项目" width="300" height="259" decoding="async">
  </div>
  <h1>我的项目</h1>
  <p>这里收录我正在维护或持续记录的项目。项目介绍以各自的公开仓库和演示页面为准。</p>
  <ul class="project-list">
    <li class="project-card">
      <span class="badge">开源工具</span>
      <h2>Cook Speed DNS</h2>
      <p>聚合 Cloudflare IPv4 候选，按电信、联通、移动分类展示，并提供 TXT 与 JSON 数据接口。</p>
      <div class="project-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/kityyJ/cook-speed-dns" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 GitHub 仓库 →</a>
        <a href="https://kityyj.github.io/cook-speed-dns/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开项目演示 →</a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="project-card">
      <span class="badge">个人博客</span>
      <h2>JIA BLOG</h2>
      <p>记录生活片段、实用经验、数码与技术内容，也把遇到的问题整理成可复用的分享。</p>
      <div class="project-links">
        <a href="https://www.jia.nz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">访问 JIA BLOG →</a>
        <a href="https://www.jia.nz/site/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解博客 →</a>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
